finish_reason.description:
Why the model stopped: `stop`, `length` (it reached
`max_output_tokens`), `tool_calls`, `content_filter` or `refusal`;
a reason this reader does not know is kept as it is.

signing_key.description:
The Secret reference of the item the key is kept in, a `keychain:`
or a `secretfile:` one, such as `keychain:goodfetch/signing-key`;
the value `identified.signing_key` then takes.

deliver.description:
